	(descr "Lumberg 1503 09, 3.5mm stereo (TRS) jack with 2 break contacts (T and R normalling), horizontal/angular, THT, Ø6 threaded bushing (3.5mm long) with knurled nut for panel mounting. Body 14.1 x 11.5 x 6mm, plug axis 3mm above PCB. Drawn from Lumberg datasheet 1503_09 (07/2025), datasheets/Lumberg_1503_09.pdf; origin = body front face on the plug axis, bushing points -X. Lumberg pins: 1=S(E) 2=T 4=T break 3=R 5=R break. Farnell 1243244.")
